  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to contribute to a sustainable and resilient transport corridor across the country, which will promote efficient connectivity and smooth flow of traffic, as well as enhance economic development. The Project Development Objective is to enhance regional connectivity, reduce transport costs, and promote inclusive economic development in Pakistan through the construction and operationalization of the M-6 segment, from Hyderabad to Sukkur, of the overall Peshawar - Karachi Motorway (PKM).</narrative>
